{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123346","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123346/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123346/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123346/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123346","id":5402450931,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQgLb8w","number":123346,"title":"Export_range minimum step size claims it's zero if very small","user":{"login":"Acamaeda","id":19804846,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODA0ODQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19804846?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Acamaeda","html_url":"https://github.com/Acamaeda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Acamaeda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Acamaeda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Acamaeda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Acamaeda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Acamaeda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Acamaeda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Acamaeda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Acamaeda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Acamaeda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:04:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T14:36:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.6 and 4.7.2.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot 4.6 + v4.7.2.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 with Max-Q Design (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1088) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads) - 15.76 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI am using @export_range with \"or_greater\", \"or_less\", and \"hide_control\" in order to allow very small numbers to be entered. However, if \"step_size\" is less than about 1e-15, it will sometimes give an error that \"step size cannot be zero\" when the object is inspected.\n\nHowever, a simpler fix would be to _allow_ step size to be zero if \"hide_control\" is true since it doesn't matter then.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n@export_range(0, 2222, 1e-30, \"or_greater\", \"or_less\", \"hide_control\") var errory: float = 1.0\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[step-size-cannot-be-zero.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32018906/step-size-cannot-be-zero.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123346/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}